      "description": "Create a single-page website using React + Three.js (WebGL) that showcases the history of PlayStation gaming consoles. The page must have: 1) A 3D interactive scene in the background using Three.js with rotating PlayStation console models (simplified geometric shapes representing PS1, PS2, PS3, PS4, PS5). 2) A timeline section with cards for each console generation (PS1 1994, PS2 2000, PS3 2006, PS4 2013, PS5 2020) with key specs. 3) Smooth scroll animations, dark theme, and responsive design. 4) Use @react-three/fiber and @react-three/drei for Three.js integration. 5) All os.getenv() MUST have defaults. NO backend API, NO database, NO auth, NO Docker.",
