      "description": "Build a browser-based ticket/request tracking application for a small IT company. Required fields: client name, phone or email, optional company, problem description, priority (low, normal, high, urgent), and status (new, in progress, waiting for client, completed, closed). Users can create, view, edit, comment on, and delete requests with confirmation. Dashboard counts new, in progress, urgent, and closed today. Search client, phone, email, and problem text. Filter by status and priority. Use a modern dark desktop and tablet interface. One local administrator, persistent local storage, real startup and working buttons, automated tests, and Windows run instructions. Choose a simple maintainable stack after requirements analysis.",
