        "required_features": [
          "Create a production-oriented cross-platform mobile application for beauty salons called:",
          "The product should provide a booking experience similar in concept to modern doctor/salon appointment applications:",
          "discover salons and beauty professionals; browse services; see real availability; book an appointment; reschedule or cancel; receive reminders; manage appointments",
          "Create an original Beauty Lip product with its own architecture, UI design, branding, and user experience",
          "Android; iOS",
          "The architecture must also include:",
          "backend API; persistent database; salon/business management interface; administrator functionality",
          "The first version must be a functional MVP, not a static design prototype",
          "beauty salons; hair salons; nail studios; brow and lash studios; cosmetology studios; makeup artists; massage and wellness studios; independent beauty professionals",
          "Customers should be able to find a salon or specialist and book an available appointment without calling",
          "Salons should be able to manage:",
          "branches; specialists; services; prices; schedules; bookings; customers; notifications",
          "Implement these roles:",
          "A customer can:",
          "register and log in; browse salons; search and filter salons; view specialists; view services and prices; see available appointment times; book an appointment; reschedule an appointment; cancel an appointment; see upcoming and previous appointments; save favorite salons and specialists; leave a rating and review after a completed appointment; manage profile and notification settings",
          "A professional can:",
          "view assigned appointments; view daily and weekly schedule; view customer and service details; mark appointment status; configure personal working hours if permitted; mark breaks and unavailable periods; view basic performance statistics",
          "A salon manager can:",
          "create and edit salon profile; manage salon branches; manage specialists; create and edit services; set prices and service duration; configure working hours; manage bookings; block unavailable time; view customers; view business statistics; manage salon photos; manage notification settings",
          "An administrator can:"
        ],
